rigin main` refspec, best-effort, and its result is recorded. Fix 2 closes the negative bill but introduces finding 1.\nChecks: touched tests: selected: tests/test_health_checkup.py tests/test_slow_tickets.py; fallback: none; result: pass (20 passed). Both new tests fail against the pre-fix script 73cdb25d and pass at the head.\nunresolved_review_comments: []\nunresolved_simplify_findings: not planned\n\nduration: duration: 2m40s\n"}

